                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ac5f584c-a5a2-339a-b37d-260ac5d3c537",
                        "entry_id": "3789782d-2a8f-38b3-847f-1dd13fcf7ddd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A piece of bread soaked in wine; a small cake made with grapes or wine."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ef7da63-c5dd-4a6f-8da9-4fd2a25db18b",
                                "sense_id": "ac5f584c-a5a2-339a-b37d-260ac5d3c537",
                                "text": "Hence the proverb […] \"to reduce one whose meal is a winesop to a dry crust.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d1426670-1938-4b01-ba30-dadce8252cbf",
                                "sense_id": "ac5f584c-a5a2-339a-b37d-260ac5d3c537",
                                "text": "Beatriz, for all her seeming frailty, had borne the long strain better, and presently came, offering winesops, the recognised restorative; small pieces of fine white bread soaked in wine."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9afe7223-2486-43ae-8388-8d75006b1235",
                                "sense_id": "ac5f584c-a5a2-339a-b37d-260ac5d3c537",
                                "text": "His wife gave her a winesop to eat and after, undressing her, put her to bed; and they contrived that night to have her and her maid carried to Florence."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6bbc9080-c136-442f-a157-aaa3fecc05d6",
                                "sense_id": "ac5f584c-a5a2-339a-b37d-260ac5d3c537",
                                "text": "Winesops\n1 cup butter\n1 1.2 cups brown sugar, firmly packed\n1 cup molasses\n[…]\n1 cup currants"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b6780115-b177-3efa-9418-236872da2093",
                        "entry_id": "3789782d-2a8f-38b3-847f-1dd13fcf7ddd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A drunkard, a wino."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly",
                            "derogatory",
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "80cf7321-e9d6-44a2-8dfe-d20f922858ca",
                                "sense_id": "b6780115-b177-3efa-9418-236872da2093",
                                "text": "\"I'm going to give you Mr. Whish — or the winesop that remains of him,\" continued Attwater."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0db65f49-db16-4ec7-9746-18a76bf71ac1",
                                "sense_id": "b6780115-b177-3efa-9418-236872da2093",
                                "text": "[…] \"we're being maneuvered into providing a gala State funeral for that reprobate winesop.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c8af7c8-35e6-44c4-9e87-413dab247d75",
                                "sense_id": "b6780115-b177-3efa-9418-236872da2093",
                                "text": "\"Aye, he was good at skulking around and acting like a winesop or an idiot.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
